# RISK WISE — local environment overrides for `npm run dev` / `npm run start:electron`.
# Copy this file to `.env` and populate values you want loaded automatically.
# `.env` is gitignored. Packaged builds do NOT read this file — distribution
# DSNs are baked into `build/sentry-dsn.json` by CI (see scripts/write-sentry-dsn.js).

# Sentry DSN for crash reporting + manual diagnostics upload (issue #119, #300).
# Empty/unset means Sentry is skipped locally and the "Send to Support" button
# is disabled with a "no DSN configured" hint.
SENTRY_DSN=
